{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48520","headline":"广陵古冢石刻 · 不详","name":"广陵古冢石刻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日爲箭兮月爲弓，四时躬人兮无穷。\n但得天将明月死，不觉人随流水空。\n山川秀兮碧穹窿，崇夫人墓兮直其中。\n猨啼鸟啸烟蒙蒙，千年万年松柏风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48520.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48520","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}